<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Include &lt;<link linkend="_normalize__dot_8hpp">glm/gtx/normalize_dot.hpp</link>&gt; to use the features of this extension.</para>

<para>Dot product of vectors that need to be normalize with a single square root.</para>
</section>
